WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,650
Okay, get up quickly

2
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,450
From now on, I'll leave the care of the home and nursing home to you.

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:07,560
Come on, eat quickly. You've had enough to eat and drink.

4
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,080
I'll take you to hunt bison tomorrow

5
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,560
Senior, I will pass the protector after I have acquired it.

6
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,720
We have to speed up the progress in these two days.

7
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:14,920
Well, don't worry

8
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,640
The morning glory will mature in two days

9
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,600
That's night

10
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,360
Maybe we can start hunting down Earth Scholars

11
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,920
Ah, Kill the Earth Scholar

12
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,560
That’s right, you’ll have to face it sooner or later

13
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:23,880
The protector is still there now

14
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:24,960
Wait until the protector passes

15
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,360
They can cause damage to cabins

16
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,560
How about we have white teeth and morning glory?

17
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,640
Go hunt them first

18
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,080
See if there are any rewards

19
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,720
Okay, listen to the seniors

20
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:35,160
Well, take good care of White Teeth for the next two days.

21
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:37,160
After all, he was the Wolf King before

22
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,640
It's quite vicious when you think about it.

23
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:39,800
It's our great strength

24
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,630
Okay

25
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,110
Follow the white tooth method of eating

26
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:45,310
We need to listen to some more parts
